Not for me (or Jenkins). Unless you are working with a locally modified make/os_mac, I don't think we have the same clang configuration. In the clang section, you need to add a

 CFLAGS += -std=c++0x

 and get rid of any

 CFLAGS_GTEST += -Wno-c++11-extensions

