OK, now I am one step closer. Possibly to the edge; possibly to a solution. The attachment is a zip archive of a git-ified directory with one file called strings_parser.txt. There are two tagged commits, g++-4.6 and g++-4.7, depending on which compiler made test/gm/parser before pulling out the unique strings. Again, that test passes under g++-4.6 and fails under g++-4.7.

Unzip that directory, go into it, and do

