This is the problem with run-time formatted I/O
that raises an exception or error.  It's a perennial problem
with printf() and why C++ prefers the << mechanisms
which can check formatting validity at compile time.

> Any *.stan file in that folder will be compiled with the test/gm/compile_models test. To get them to be part of the
